{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "618c1a5c-e081-8d67-b600-65c7507c40a0",
  "created_at": "2026-02-11T10:54:59-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Brendan Donovan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:53:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:53:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hello. Um, is this the housing office? For the Naval base? The housing office on the base?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:53:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, sir, this is the City Clerk's office, City of Newport. We're not the base housing office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:53:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no. Oh, I'm sorry. I'm so sorry. Is that okay? I mean, did I call the wrong, the city, I thought I had the right number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:53:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. It happens. Where did you get the number you dialed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:53:48-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Off a website, I think. Well, I was filling out a form this morning, and the autofill typed in the wrong address, like it put in an old one, so I'm worried now I messed up the whole thing. Is that going to be a problem? For the form, I mean."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:54:06-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't see your form from here, so I couldn't say. The housing office would be the one to ask about that. They're a separate office from the city, run through the Navy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:54:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right, the Navy. So you don't have their number, or, it's not something you can transfer me to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:54:25-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't transfer you to the base. What I'd suggest is searching for the Naval Station Newport housing office on the official Navy website, and use the number listed there. Take your time with it, and double-check the digits."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:54:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Navy website, official one. Not the autofill, ha. Sorry. Sorry again, I know you're busy. It's okay that I called you, though?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:54:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfectly okay, Mr. Donovan. No trouble at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:54:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. I'll look it up. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:54:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Good luck with it. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
